"config_property_copy_button:+++quarkus.cyclonedx.embedded.compress+++[]\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"[.description]\n"
"--\n"
"Controls whether the embedded SBOM is served GZIP-compressed through the _endpoint_. This option does not affect how the SBOM is stored in the application: the embedded SBOM resource is always stored uncompressed.\n"
"\n"
" * if set to `true`, the endpoint always serves the SBOM compressed with `Content-Encoding: gzip`;\n"
" * if set to `false`, the endpoint always serves the SBOM uncompressed;\n"
" * if not set, the endpoint negotiates the encoding based on the request's `Accept-Encoding` header, serving the SBOM compressed only when the client accepts `gzip`.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
